{
  "category": "Ball Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "It stores electric energy under very high pressure. It often explodes with little or no provocation.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "It stores electric energy under very high pressure. It often explodes with little or no provocation.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stores electrical energy inside its body. Even the slightest shock could trigger a huge explosion.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is dangerous. If it has too much electricity and has nothing to do, it amuses itself by exploding.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "It stores an overflowing amount of electric energy inside its body. Even a small shock makes it explode.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "The more energy it charges up, the faster it gets. But this also makes it more likely to explode.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "ELECTRODE eats electricity in the atmosphere. On days when lightning strikes, you can see this POKéMON exploding all over the place from eating too much electricity.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "One of ELECTRODE’s characteristics is its attraction to electricity. It is a problematical POKéMON that congregates mostly at electrical power plants to feed on electricity that has just been generated.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "They appear in great numbers at electric power plants. Because they feed on electricity, they cause massive and chaotic blackouts in nearby cities.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It explodes in response to even minor stimuli. It is feared, with the nickname of “The Bomb Ball.”",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "It stores electric energy under very high pressure. It often explodes with little or no provocation.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is known to drift on winds if it is bloated to bursting with stored electricity.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is known to drift on winds if it is bloated to bursting with stored electricity.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
